<title>GERMANY: Loesch shares to trade in Frankfurt's New Market.</title>
<headline>Loesch shares to trade in Frankfurt's New Market.</headline>
<dateline>DUELMEN, Germany 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Loesch Umweltschutz AG, the German waste disposal group, will in future be traded in the New Market section of the Frankfurt bourse, the company said on Monday, following a decision by its management board to that effect.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
